\f2\fs20 \cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Down the hallway, an understated and masculine bathroom awaits, a refuge of quiet sophistication amidst the opulence. The walls wear a cool shade of charcoal gray, exuding a sense of calm strength. Soft, indirect lighting casts a warm glow, offering respite from the world beyond.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A sizable mirror adorns one wall, framed in brushed metal, its straightforward design reflecting practicality rather than flamboyance. Its presence is purposeful, ready to aid in daily routines without unnecessary embellishment.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The centerpiece is a freestanding bathtub, bold in its simplicity. Crafted from matte black stone, it stands as a monolithic statement of elegance. No frills, no fuss\uc0\u8212 just an invitation to soak away the cares of the day in dignified solitude.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Adjacent to it, a walk-in shower is a study in minimalism. Stainless steel fixtures ensure efficient functionality while the wide rain showerhead offers a cascade of rejuvenation. Gray porcelain tiles line the floor and walls, sturdy and unpretentious.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A sleek vanity houses his-and-his sinks, featuring smooth concrete countertops with a slight patina of age, hinting at a life well-lived. Dark wood cabinets beneath provide ample storage, while simple metal handles add a touch of industrial chic.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>At the touch of a button, a built-in sound system softly plays a playlist of mellow jazz, setting a contemplative tone. Aromatic cedarwood notes linger in the air, a nod to nature\'a1\'afs essence without overpowering the space.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The towels, stacked neatly on a wooden shelf, embody a sense of purpose\uc0\u8212 thick and absorbent, ready to provide comfort without excess frill. A solitary potted succulent rests on the windowsill, a testament to the beauty of life\'a1\'afs uncomplicated moments.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>In this bathroom, every element speaks of refined masculinity. It\'a1\'afs a space designed for functionality and tranquility, where luxury resides in the unspoken details and the balance between strength and serenity.\
